			"notes": "- TheFirst's ring lights now render mirrored\n- Updated config format from 1 to 2 to update default controller profile. All existing profiles should get automatically migrated upon loading\n- Added most settings to the settings menu\n- Added setting for Bloomfog render method: stereo, mono, desktop.\n  - stereo renders to both eyes and the desktop\n  - mono only renders on the first pass (this has severely poor quality)\n  - desktop only renders Bloomfog on the desktop mirror and not in the VR view (good for recording if you can afford the performance for 1 pass but not 3)\n- Added a warning that appears if you play a map in VR while FPFC is enabled\n- Fixed saber bloom\n- Fixed beatmap spawning at eye height instead of floor height\n- Fixed block break override not working when you held the break button\n- Fixed smoke rendering really bright when bloom is disabled\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Swifter1243/BeatCraft/compare/1.21.1-0.9.2...1.21.1-0.9.3"
		},
