			"notes": "# Beatcraft 1.21.1-0.9.1\n- Fixed light blending, this fixes visual artifacts such as lights being cut off when intersecting, particularly obvious in Weave.\n- Fixed audio threads being left hanging when exiting a map partway through.\n- Added support for Chroma events:\n  - Spinning light events\n  - Ring light rotation events\n  - Ring light zoom events\n- Fixed how lights get clipped to avoid visual artifacts with mirrors\n- Added Big Mirror environment\n- Removed 2 lights from weave that weren't supposed to exist\n- Several fixes to the V3 lighting system\n- Weave's lights have been changed to have a more accurate color fall-off\n- Red and Blue sabers now appear in the creative inventory\n- Added settings to disable flickering lights in light shows, Expert+ has a separate setting from the other difficulties\n- Ghost note arrows now dissolve during the jump animation to match Beat Saber behavior\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Swifter1243/BeatCraft/compare/1.21.1-0.9.0-alpha.3...1.21.1-0.9.1"
		},
