			"notes": "# Beatcraft 1.21.1-0.9.0-alpha.3\n- Sabers now render in 3rd person. This has caused a bug where saber bloom will appear in world space where it shouldn't, will be fixed eventually.\n- Audio is now streamed! no more freezing when selecting a map to play.\n- Distortion walls now work more consistently\n- Added new meshes for environments that can optionally be rendered during a map.\n- All light elements are now correctly positioned to the map's world position\n- Re-added smoke\n- Kaleidoscope lights are now mirrored correctly\n- Notes should no longer have specks from the dissolve shader when not dissolved\n- A handful of other small changes\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Swifter1243/BeatCraft/compare/1.21.1-0.9.0-alpha.2...1.21.1-0.9.0-alpha.3"
